        </p>
        <h1 class="section-heading-home">
            Quality course, instructor & support
        </h1>
        <p class="section-subheading-home">CEF Online offers highly researched Islamic education
            globally, featuring online courses, trainings, workshops, and self learning eBooks
        </p>
